Actually, it exists only as a communication medium between humans and AI=E2=
=80=99s=20
so dominant at the time. Despite being an overused idea, its fresh blood=20
comes from its Arabic-Eastern culture POV that, to my experience, is very=
=20
rare in the western -and generally the global- market.

I=E2=80=99m currently working -if you'd call what I'm work- on (Renodre=CC=
=81), a=20
fictional language another =E2=80=98entity=E2=80=99 uses in the story; it=
=E2=80=99s, however, meant=20
to be a personal language that is subject to normal flaws of natural=20
languages. Its development didn=E2=80=99t help me in the logical human-AI l=
anguage=20
thing.

I understand that if a large institution funds such a large project, it wil=
l=20
be greatly skewed in favour of its needs. However, how about seeking fundin=
g=20
from several large institutions, each funds the aspect it needs (a bit=20
shallow I know), but with general guidelines laid out to prevent any from=
=20
gaining advantage over the other, and to make sure it meets its purpose for=
=20
public usage.

If you can get academic support in form of linguists and mathematicians, I=
=20
believe that although Lojban needed 25 years of development over Loglan=E2=
=80=99s=20
30, *Loghnat *(a name I chose) would roughly take 10 years over Loglan=E2=
=80=99s and=20
Lojban=E2=80=99s 55 with merely academic linguistic and mathematical suppor=
t and=20
very little general public donations.

Just look at the amount of advertisement and support Na=E2=80=99v=C3=AD get=
s, just=20
because it was used in James=E2=80=99 Cameron=E2=80=99s gorgeous, shallow A=
vatar! How in=20
life would primitive jungle-dependant life forms have *formal and informal =
*sentences=20
in their language, let alone the tremendous amount of rules in it, they=20
haven=E2=80=99t had the time to write all this, have they?

I=E2=80=99m one of the few who believe in pure-thought theory, although alt=
ered to=20
replace language with visual clues instead of the=20
undefined-pure-thought-raw-material in which others believed, so I never=20
really had any interest in the Sapir-Whorf hypothesis, although I=E2=80=99m=
=20
beginning to change my mind.

Google is currently funding several linguistic and artistic projects for=20
Egyptian graduates, maybe you know someone here who might be a possible=20
candidate to propose this to Google? I know it=E2=80=99s weird from to say =
this=20
(living in Egypt and all!) but I=E2=80=99m afraid I don=E2=80=99t know any =
suitable ones=20
here, I don=E2=80=99t know if you have any in your community however. I=E2=
=80=99ll and check=20
the university but without promises.

I=E2=80=99ll write the two follow ups later, I need to go.

